DATA AND SERVICE ATTRIBUTION

This project's code is MIT licensed. It displays and combines third-party data
and services, which remain under their own terms:

  AQHI data: Environmental Protection Department, HKSAR Government, via
  DATA.GOV.HK (https://data.gov.hk).

  Pollutant concentrations: Air quality data by Open-Meteo.com
  (https://open-meteo.com/), licensed CC BY 4.0; underlying data from the
  Copernicus Atmosphere Monitoring Service (CAMS), ECMWF.

  Basemap: Tiles (c) Esri - Canvas World Light Gray Base; source Esri, HERE,
  Garmin, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors. Map library: Leaflet
  (https://leafletjs.com).

The MIT licence above applies to the code only and does not extend to the data,
tiles or services listed here.
